{
  "version": 1,
  "name": "Wonk Dive",
  "prompt": "halftime FM wonk bass at 140: a round FM bass that dives in pitch on every note, an FM-index envelope, a squelchy resonant filter envelope and a glassy upper partial; short, dry and punchy, with Wonk adding bend-in, index and squelch",
